{"title":"The Lazy Swordmaster","synopsis":"Dia adalah seorang pejuang yang dipilih oleh Pedang Suci terlepas dari keinginannya demi umat manusia tetapi dia menjadi lelah hidup untuk orang lain Demi keselamatan dia mengalahkan musuh terakhir Raja Iblis dan memutuskan untuk mati Untuk meringankan beban menjadi seorang pejuang dan master dari pedang suci dia akan menyerah pada hidupnya dan jatuh ke dalam istirahat abadi Oh Sepertinya tuan muda ingin mengambil pedang itu secepat mungkin Hitung Lihat tuannya Dia pasti sudah menunjukkan minat pada pedang Putra bungsu dari ahli pedang yang menyerahkan nyawanya untuk melarikan diri dari pedang telah bereinkarnasi Aku lebih baik mati lagi","alternative_title":"Updating","author":"Chorok Cha","artist":"","genres":["Action","Adventure","Comedy","Drama","Fantasy"],"chapters":[{"id":"108901db-b056-4294-ab33-45a4ce1e8de6","number":"121","title":"Chapter 121","date":"2024-11-26","images":[]},{"id":"045a149e-3e4c-44f4-bf03-831d09d4df10","number":"120","title":"Chapter 120","date":"2024-11-26","images":[]},{"id":"95b01e6f-eed5-4db6-a2fe-85d5696d0b41","number":"119","title":"Chapter 119","date":"2024-11-26","images":[]},{"id":"cd53eb5b-0d68-4058-8044-e05aaaac33de","number":"118","title":"Chapter 118","date":"2024-11-26","images":[]},{"id":"2030344a-d1ff-47b0-82cf-1686595bc51c","number":"117","title":"Chapter 117","date":"2024-12-03","images":[]},{"id":"051fd4ad-bdff-4997-8dac-d66eb8bc7c1f","number":"116","title":"Chapter 116","date":"2024-12-03","images":[]},{"id":"63a495e0-0bd5-4b4d-a0e6-7d58d4d438bb","number":"115","title":"Chapter 115","date":"2024-12-03","images":[]},{"id":"f2749429-ac25-4d5e-9244-6df9230c8704","number":"114","title":"Chapter 114","date":"2024-12-03","images":[]},{"id":"6f4d8ffb-d36c-4554-947c-b70e34d2b5f9","number":"113","title":"Chapter 113","date":"2024-12-03","images":[]},{"id":"aac1f333-d434-472a-87c5-8504c7aebae5","number":"112","title":"Chapter 112","date":"2024-12-03","images":[]},{"id":"cd45cfc5-62ea-4b